Subject: [PATCH] No chat sign

---
 .../arguments/ArgumentSignatures.java         |  5 +++++
 .../protocol/game/ServerboundChatPacket.java  |  4 ++++
 .../ServerboundChatSessionUpdatePacket.java   |  5 +++++
 .../network/protocol/status/ServerStatus.java | 12 ++++++++++--
 .../server/dedicated/DedicatedServer.java     |  2 +-
 .../ServerCommonPacketListenerImpl.java       | 19 +++++++++++++++++--
